  const context=card(title('','What This Mode Answers')+'<p><b>Near-term outlook:</b> What does the latest published standing-crop situation show, and what official weather/climate conditions should be monitored for the selected province?</p><p class="muted">This mode is descriptive planning context. It is not another XGBoost prediction and does not change ANI\'s quarterly yield estimate.</p>','bluePanel');
