      <div class="infoBox currentPlanningNotice" role="note"><strong>Data timing:</strong> The latest integrated PSA standing-crop release covers <b>${s.referencePeriod||'Unavailable'}</b>, based on standing crops as of ${s.asOfDate||'Unavailable'}, and was released ${releaseLabel}. The next 2026 MPCSRS release is scheduled for ${nextLabel}. This prevents ANI from presenting unreleased Q4 crop figures as if they were current official data.</div>
